    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# daily_news_summary\n\nFull pipeline:\n\n1. **Cron** triggers at 09:00 and 22:00\n2. **RSS feeds** fetch headlines from each source\n3. **Prepare nodes** shape each source into the fn_add_articles() contract\n4. **fn_add_articles()** fetches + extracts full article text\n5. **fn_filter_articles()** filters out non-relevant articles\n6. **Loop** translates + summarizes each relevant article\n7. **Aggregate**: all summaries collected, LLM writes a daily overview\n8. **Output**: Markdown file saved + email sent",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 544
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        8896,
        -768
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "6fc60142-f69a-4764-b4d1-3addd94f6cfb",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Source Preparation\n\nEach Prepare node shapes its RSS items into the `fn_add_articles()` contract:\n\n```\n{\n  articles: [...],\n  required: ['title', 'link'],\n  mapped: {\n    title: 'title',\n    pubDate: ['pubDate', 'isoDate'],\n    snippet: ['contentSnippet', 'content']\n  }\n}\n```\n\n`source` and `selector` (CSS) are injected per-source so the extractor knows where to find the article body.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 516
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        7792,
        -864
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a23b135a-f8f4-4679-a14c-b203fd19e71e",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Translate & Summarize loop\n1 article per iteration.\n\nThe LLM receives the full article text (or snippet) and produces an **ADHD-friendly English summary** regardless of the original language.\n\n`<think>` blocks from reasoning models are stripped before the summary is attached to the article.",
        "height": 144,
        "width": 512
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        9744,
        352
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "6b9f4df6-860f-4ec6-8f62-68728c97e088",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Overview Generation\n\nAfter all articles are processed, a second LLM call writes a **daily overview** from all individual summaries.\n\nThe overview and article list are then assembled into a single Markdown document:\n\n```\n# Daily News Briefing — YYYY-MM-DD\n## Overview\n...\n## Articles\n### Title\n...\n```\n\nOutput: saved as a `.md` file + sent by email.",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 592
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        9760,
        -576
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "80bc480a-a3a1-4c33-ba1f-acf0c097a94b",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
